      "body": "Uncover. Cook until a fork twists in the meat with little resistance and a dark bark has formed, ≈1 h more (internal ≈<span class=\"rc-nw\">200 °F <span class=\"rc-muted\">(93 °C)</span></span>)."
    },
    {
      "kind": "step",
      "ings": [],
      "body": "Move pork to a large bowl. Keep the liquid in the pot and skim off the fat. Once it’s cool enough to handle, shred the pork with two forks."
